<view class="hub">
<view class="english-heading"><view class="eyebrow"><lookup-text text="A LITTLE EVERY DAY" source="页面寄语"/></view><speech-button text="A LITTLE EVERY DAY" compact="{{true}}" label="听读"/></view><view class="title">让记忆，再亮一点。</view>
<block wx:if="{{!active && !finished}}"><view class="subtitle">从已经走过的路里，捡起几个熟悉的词。</view><view class="practice-art">✦<text>每一次回忆，都是进步</text></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="name">{{book.name}} · 随机小测</text><text class="tag">最多 10 题</text></view><view class="muted spaced">{{learnedCount?'从本词书已学的 '+learnedCount+' 个词中抽取。':'还没有已学单词，先用入门词试一轮。'}}</view><button class="primary full spaced" bindtap="start">{{learnedCount?'开始小测':'试试入门练习'}} →</button></view><view class="stat-grid"><view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{stats.rounds}}</text><text class="muted">完成练习</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{stats.correct}}</text><text class="muted">累计答对</text></view></view><view class="notice">小测不改变登山和复习进度。营地复习仍按记忆间隔安排。</view></block>
<block wx:elif="{{active}}"><view class="row spaced"><text class="muted">{{index+1}} / {{total}} {{sample?'· 入门体验':'· 已学词巩固'}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="exit">结束练习</text></view><view class="bar"><view class="fill" style="width:{{(index+1)/total*100}}%"/></view><view class="quiz-word">{{word.w}}</view><view class="phonetic">{{word.ph}}</view><view class="word-audio"><speech-button text="{{word.w}}" label="单词发音" /></view><button wx:for="{{question.options}}" wx:key="*this" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choose" disabled="{{answered}}" class="choice {{selected===index?'selected':''}}">{{item}}</button><view wx:if="{{answered}}" class="card spaced"><view>{{feedback}}</view><view class="muted spaced"><lookup-text text="{{word.ex}}" source="{{word.w+' · 练习例句'}}"/></view><speech-button text="{{word.ex}}" label="朗读例句" /><view class="muted">{{word.exZh}}</view><button class="primary full spaced" bindtap="next">{{index+1===total?'查看结果':'下一题'}}</button></view></block>
<block wx:else><view class="practice-art">{{correct}} / {{total}}<text>这轮练习完成了</text></view><view wx:if="{{mistakes.length}}" class="section-title">带走这些还不熟的词</view><view wx:for="{{mistakes}}" wx:key="w" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="name"><lookup-text text="{{item.w}}" source="练习错词"/></view><speech-button text="{{item.w}}" label="再听一遍" /></view><view class="muted">{{item.mean}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!mistakes.length}}" class="empty">这轮全部答对。把这份记忆带上山吧。</view><button class="primary full" bindtap="start">再练一轮</button><button class="secondary full spaced" bindtap="back">回到练习页</button></block>
</view>
